  "The album holds 58 images with no captions at all: every data-caption is empty and every alt is \"Album Image  #NNNNN\". None can be identified or ordered without visual review.",
  "The album is far larger than a single outdoor sitting area needs and appears to mix images belonging to several different amenities; confirm with the client which images actually belong to this article.",
  "Only _thumb.jpg derivatives appear as absolute CDN URLs; full-resolution originals are site-relative fancybox hrefs (../../loggia-cdn/lodgeContent/<hash>-1.jpg).",
  "Body copy is 25 words total for 58 images — the copy-to-imagery ratio is very thin and the page will need new copy on re-platform.",
